cat .gitignore
```

It probably doesn't have `node_modules` in it. Fix it:

**Add this to your root `.gitignore`:**
```
# Dependencies
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Python
acpenv/
backend/acpenv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Environment
.env
**/.env

# Database
content.db
*.db

# RAG storage
rag_storage/
*.faiss
*.chunks.json

# Next.js
frontend/.next/
.next/

# Build
dist/
build/